WEBVTT

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.290
It was a time of war.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:09.330
The Liu Bei–led Shu army, having come under attack
by the Wu general Lu Xun at the Battle of Xiaoting,

00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:11.420
was facing certain doom.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.250
Zhuge Kongming, who had predicted Liu Bei's defeat,

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.580
enticed the enemy to enter his
secretly-planned Stone Sentinel Maze,

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:21.500
thereby brilliantly saving his lord from a dire situation.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.080
Fast forward to the present.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.670
Kongming's new master, Eiko Tsukimi,

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.380
also found herself driven into a corner.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.170
I'll give you the chance to appear at
an event I'll be performing at.

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:36.540
She had landed a big gig,
but Eiko's joy was short lived...

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.580
I go on at the same time as Mia?

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:39.920
Oh my god!

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:42.000
She learned it was a trap set by the enemy.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.670
<b>Sayonara Twintails</b>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.670
<b>Happy Flower</b>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.670
<b>Negirikko</b>

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.670
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.250
But if she succeeded,

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.080
<b>Happy Flower</b>

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.080
<b>Negirikko</b>

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:45.080
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.630
it would be the chance of a lifetime.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.630
<b>Orange Lemon</b>

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.170
A command for Kongming the Tactician!

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:50.830
Get the place packed to capacity for my performance!

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:53.880
I have been waiting to hear you say that.

00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:57.880
With help from the revived-in-the-present
Stone Sentinel Maze,

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:02.460
